<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Dec yr current account deficit NZ$3.91 bln.</title>
<headline>NZ Dec yr current account deficit NZ$3.91 bln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Thursday released the following balance of payments data for the December 1996 quarter and the year to December.</p>
<p>Rounded actual figures, in millions of NZ dollars (- is deficit). &quot;Revised from&quot; figures are in brackets.</p>
<p>		    Dec 1996 qtr     Sept 1996 qtr    Dec 1995 qtr</p>
<p>Merch trade	    +40		-317		   -52</p>
<p>Invisibles	   -1331	     -1631 (-1854)	-944</p>
<p>Balance		-1292	     -1948 (-2171)	-996</p>
</text>
